rve all accessories. Keep the same whole-canvas framing and character scale—NO enlarge, shrink, recenter or translate. Only the torso/shoulder construction changes. Keep the far rightmost ribbon end safely inside the existing canvas; if needed bend only that tip inward, no figure movement.\n\nPolished black-gold brocade and teal Q-style materials unchanged. Blank scroll, no text. True transparent background; square canvas at least1024x1024 with transparent border around every ribbon/prop. Do not turn the head/body front-on, do not show the back torso, do not exchange hands or props. Output just the one corrected independent frame09.\nExactly two sleeves, each ending in its one real hand. The near LEFT crossing sleeve is one continuous solid sleeve from the near shoulder to the scroll cuff; no intermediate open empty cuff or third sleeve on the chest.",
